# Note for this repo

`mcp-security-guard` is **not** an early zero-dep MVP sibling. Follow `.cursor/rules/mcp-security-guard.mdc` and `PRIVACY.md`.

When adding tools: register in the existing SDK server, keep confirm gates, update README tools table + CHANGELOG, add vitest coverage, and never weaken fail-open / minimal-egress cloud contracts.
